sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant C as Client
 participant E as ESTS
 participant U as User
 Note over C,E: ConvergedTFA offers PhoneAppOTP
 C->>E: POST {urlBeginAuth}
 Note over C,E: AuthMethodId=PhoneAppOTP, Method=BeginAuth, ctx, flowToken, SAS canary<br/>header
 E-->>C: Success=true, FlowToken, Ctx, SessionId
 loop repeat
   Note over C,E: user submits a code within local deadline
  U-->>C: OTP as a string, preserving leading zeroes
  C->>E: POST {urlEndAuth} (JSON)
  Note over C,E: AdditionalAuthData=trimmed OTP, AuthMethodId, Method=EndAuth,<br/>BeginAuth SessionId, FlowToken, Ctx, SAS canary header
  alt recoverable code rejection
   E-->>C: Success=false, diagnostic code-rejection details
   Note over E,C: Retry may be absent or false
   Note over C,E: Re-prompt using retained challenge state, do not repeat BeginAuth<br/>Do not infer recoverability merely from presence of Message
  else terminal or unrecognized failure
   E-->>C: Failure or HTML service error
   break terminal failure
    Note over C,E: Stop or explicit recovery, no ProcessAuth
   end
  else code accepted
   E-->>C: Success=true, FlowToken, Ctx
   C->>E: POST {MFA-page urlPost}
   Note over C,E: request=successful Ctx, flowToken=successful FlowToken,<br/>mfaAuthMethod=PhoneAppOTP, login, MFA-page canary
   E-->>C: Authorization response, interrupt, continuation, or error
   break code accepted
    Note over C,E: Leave code-entry loop and dispatch completion response
   end
  end
 end
